        "title": "Fantastic chemical free protection that actually works",
        "text": "I really this Natural Dog Tag Flea & Tick Repeller. I was really looking for a safe, non-toxic alternative to harsh chemical topicals and oral pills, and this pendant setup has been the perfect solution. It comes in a small tin can, 2 pink holders preloaded and 4 refills. Great deal for the price.Upon opening the box the first thing you notice is the smell. It's not a harsh or even bad smell it smells more natural so it's not bothersome. It does not come with a collar, but it is incredibly easy to clip right onto our dog's existing harness and collar setups. The pink color is super cute and looks like a stylish little accessory rather than a pest treatment. It is also waterproof. It gives me so much peace of mind knowing she is completely protected without exposing her to harsh chemical treatments. I highly recommend this to any pet parent looking for a safe, natural, and effective defense system!",
