        "text": "I was so hoping this Trihood Natural Dog Tag for fleas and ticks would have been just the ticket that we needed to help combat our large tick population we are dealing with here in Missouri. Unfortunately my dog is still picking up ticks after wearing this pendant on his collar for several days now. Just this morning I pulled off a tick that was literally three inches away from the pendant. I’m not sure if it’s less efficient on long hair dogs than it is on short haired pups maybe? I have a very hairy Australian Shepherd that loves to run through our hayfields where I’m quite sure he’s picking up the ticks. I really wanted to be able to use something natural instead of having to use poison on my dog, so I tried this, but it sadly is just not doing to job for my dog. It was super easy to put on my dog’s collar and the smell is mild and pleasant, I just wish it worked for us.",
